        "Content": "RAY COOKE LETTINGS PLEASE FOLLOW US ON FACEBOOK AND INSTAGRAM AS PROPERTIES ARE ADVERTISED THERE FIRST VIDEO VIEWINGS AVAILABLE ON REQUEST\r\n *** STUNNING 2 BEDROOM / 1 BATHROOM APARTMENT *** REGISTER YOUR INTEREST TODAY ***\r\nRAY COOKE LETTINGS are delighted to present this superb two-bedroom, one-bathroom apartment to the rental market, coming soon to the highly sought-after The Courthouse development in Rathcoole, Co. Dublin.\r\nThis bright and spacious apartment is presented in excellent condition throughout and offers well-proportioned living accommodation finished to a high standard. The property comprises an inviting entrance hallway, a generous open-plan living and dining area, a modern fully fitted kitchen with integrated appliances, two spacious double bedrooms with fitted wardrobes, and a stylish main bathroom.\r\nThe Courthouse is ideally situated in the heart of Rathcoole Village, with an excellent selection of local shops, cafés, restaurants, schools, and leisure facilities all within walking distance. The area enjoys superb transport links, with easy access to the N7, M50, and surrounding road networks, while a range of Dublin Bus services provide convenient access to Dublin City Centre and neighbouring areas.\r\nThis is an excellent opportunity to secure a quality home in one of South Dublin's most desirable commuter locations. Early interest is highly recommended.\r\n \r\nAdditional Features:\r\n\r\nStunning 2 Bed / 1 Bath apartment\r\nBright and spacious living accommodation\r\nModern fully fitted kitchen with integrated appliances\r\nStylish main bathroom\r\nTwo spacious double bedrooms with fitted wardrobes\r\nPrime village location\r\nWalking distance to local shops, cafés, schools and amenities\r\nExcellent transport links with easy access to the N7, M50 and Dublin City Centre\r\nRegister your interest today\r\n \r\nRAY COOKE LETTINGS EMAIL ENQUIRIES ONLY / NO PHONE CALLS PLEASE FILL IN YOUR CONTACT INFORMATION ON THE RIGHT-HAND SIDE AND CLICK SEND MESSAGE WE WILL CONTACT YOU WITH VIEWING DETAILS WHEN THEY ARISE."
